4, "name": "7日上新", "text": "1天前發佈，租到概率高", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_04.png"}, {"id": 8, "name": "超棒生活機能", "text": "周邊有百貨公司/傳統市場/公園綠地/醫療機構/學校", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_08.png"}]}, "remark": {"title": "屋主說", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">一年約租金13500（無折扣）</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">兩年約租金12500（當天下定，首月租金5折）</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">洗衣機有自己使用的，不與他人共用</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">衣服晾自己房內的「陽台」</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#cc0000;\">平常較忙，請用LINE預約看房<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">截圖讓我知道你要看的是這間房</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">先變成自己喜歡的樣子，</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">再遇上一些無需取悅的人，</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">一起活出自在的生活</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">換一種方式生活，讓自己活出寬敞</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">居家清潔人員定期來打掃。共用空間保持乾淨</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">＃巷口就有7-11、小吃街、小北百貨、全聯</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">＃理髮院／圖書館／忠義廟／書局／五金行走路都可到</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">＃珈瑪商圈／家樂福就在附近</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">＃機車族較適合三民高中捷運站＋蘆洲捷運站中間點</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">＃手搖杯／鹹酥雞／麻辣鍋／魯味／東山鴨頭／鹽水雞都很美味</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">【地點】公車站牌、Ubike步行2分鐘</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">【樓層】公寓無電梯，天天健所有益健康</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">【能源費】水、電、瓦斯、網路、飲水機租賃、清潔費室友均攤</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝房間給自己獨處用</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝洗衣機不共用，自己一台</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝雙人床（加一人加1000元，最多住2位）</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝衣櫃，雙開門雙抽屜，一個人很夠用</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝廁所自己專屬</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝客廳、餐桌、廚房、發想角落給想要交流又想要大空間的我們一起使用</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝共居生活習慣必需良好：我有把握只要您也想提升生活品質，共享餐廳、客廳、發想角落，簡單守則可以永保像民宿飯店一樣乾淨清爽，歡迎您先來看房，徵喜歡生活交流的好朋友們，一起打造更好的生活品質</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝附近都是好吃五顆星的美食，容易變胖XD</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">㊝靜巷，晚上可以早早就睡覺；爬高，每天為自己練練腳力也不錯</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">#帳單分算自己繳才划算，尤其是電費</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">#堅持嚴選好溝通不計較的室友，好室友才長久</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">#性別友善最大的愛是尊重</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">LINE&nbsp;：直接按右下角的LINE就可以加到我喔</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#cc0000;\">平常較忙，請用LINE預約看房<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, &\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffcccc;\">截圖讓我知道你要看的是這間房</span></span></span>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近蘆洲捷運站、民權西路捷運站、徐匯中學捷運站、台北火車站、板橋火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區長安街111巷", "lat": "25.0803750", "lng": "121.4605890", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "忠義廟站", "distance": 99, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約99公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "長安里站", "distance": 150, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約150公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "中原長安街口站", "distance": 252, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約252公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "I KISS Hair Salon", "distance": 1016, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1016公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "泰緬風味小館", "distance": 60, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約60公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市蘆洲區成功國民小學", "distance": 672, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約672公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立蘆洲國民中學", "distance": 953, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約953公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "12,500元/月 (可申請租金補貼)", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "無", "key": "manageprice"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "10坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "建物面積", "value": "見使照", "key": "buildArea", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": 